# Frontend UI (Learner)

## Layout shell

- Learner pages render inside `UserLayout`: `bg-zinc-950`, `text-zinc-200`, `container mx-auto px-4 py-8`.
- Do not duplicate full-page backgrounds on every page — rely on layout + local `max-w-*` wrappers.

## Design tokens (match existing pages)

| Role | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Page title | `text-3xl font-bold text-white` |
| Subtitle | `text-zinc-500 mt-2` |
| Primary CTA | `bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-xl` |
| Secondary | `bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 border border-zinc-700 rounded-xl` |
| Card / panel | `bg-zinc-900/50 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800` |
| Muted text | `text-zinc-400` / `text-zinc-500` |
| Success / score | `bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/30 text-green-400` |
| Accent gradient | `bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-cyan-400` (headlines only) |

Primary accent: **indigo**. Avoid introducing new palette families (e.g. purple buttons) on learner pages.

## Reuse before creating

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Actions | `ActionButton` (`primary`, `add`, `edit`, `delete`, sizes `sm`/`md`/`lg`) |
| Search | `SearchInput` (admin pattern; OK for learner lists) |
| Nav | `Navbar` — add links there for new learner routes |
| Links | `react-router-dom` `Link` / `useNavigate` |

New shared learner blocks → `components/learner/<feature>/` (e.g. `TopicCard`, `ScoreBadge`, `FeedbackPanel`).

## Page structure template

```jsx
<div className="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8">
  <header className="mb-8">
    <h2 className="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Title</h2>
    <p className="text-zinc-500 mt-2">Subtitle</p>
  </header>
  {/* content */}
</motion>
```

## States (required on data pages)

Every list/detail/feature view must handle:

1. **Loading** — `text-center py-20 text-zinc-500` (same as `History.jsx`)
2. **Empty** — icon + short message inside `bg-zinc-900/50 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800`
3. **Error** — `text-red-400` message + optional retry button (`ActionButton variant="primary"`)

## Responsive

- Mobile-first: stack with `flex-col`; grids `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3/4`.
- Full-width buttons on small screens: `w-full sm:w-auto`.
- Speaking/practice: keep primary controls thumb-friendly (`py-3`/`py-4`, large tap targets).

## Feature UI guidance

| Feature | UI notes |
|---------|----------|
| Topic browsing | Card grid like `Speaking.jsx` step 1 but bind `topicId`, `topicName`, `difficultyLevel` |
| Question practice | List rows in bordered panel; one clear primary action per row |
| Speaking / record | Separate controls: start/stop; transcript in `bg-zinc-900/80 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-zinc-800` |
| AI feedback | Show `overallScore` + `feedbackText`; label as examiner feedback, not "browser AI" |
| Profile | Form in single card; enum selects for `level` / goals |

## Copy

- User-facing strings: **Vietnamese** (consistent with `Home`, `History`, `Login`).
- Keep tone concise; no lorem ipsum.

## Do not

- Inline 20+ line class strings repeatedly — extract a small component or constant `cardClass`.
- Mix admin table-dense styling on learner flows (learner = cards + spacious spacing).
- Add new CSS files unless necessary; prefer Tailwind utilities like existing pages.
